{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refreshAuthToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reason","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inRetryLoop","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"reason","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reason from the webhook response."}]}]},{"name":"inRetryLoop","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether a retry loop got the 401."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a loop, a failure is treated as transient: the previous token is kept and the loop is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still told to retry. Each failure in a row doubles the wait before the injector is called"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AuthRefreshBackoff\/delayMs(failures:)"},{"type":"text","text":"); a loop’s 401 that arrives sooner skips it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the loop’s retry waits until then, but at most 5s for it ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loopRetryDelay(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"). A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one-shot call ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inRetryLoop"},{"type":"text","text":" false) always calls it and gets its error thrown: the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retried on purpose, the token API may be back, and the injector’s error is how the app learns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"why it failed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each 401 makes its own call; they do not join one call, since an injector that never settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would then hold every later 401 too. A call that settles after a later one already set its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"token neither sets its own nor changes the backoff, so an older token never overrides a newer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, and a call still pending when the client activates again does not override the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session’s token. 401s that arrive together, such as the sync loop’s and the Watch streams’"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the token expires, count as one failure."}]},{"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The injector’s error, for a one-shot call."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"extendedModule":"Yorkie","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:6Yorkie6ClientC16refreshAuthToken6reason11inRetryLoopySSSg_SbtYaKF","role":"symbol","title":"refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refreshAuthToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reason"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"inRetryLoop"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/refreshauthtoken(reason:inretryloop:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"authTokenInjector"},{"type":"text","text":" for a new token after a 401."}],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client","title":"Client","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is a normal client that can communicate with the server."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has documents and sends changes of the documents in local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to synchronize with other replicas in remote."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"title":"Yorkie","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client/refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)":{"title":"refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/refreshauthtoken(reason:inretryloop:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refreshAuthToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reason","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inRetryLoop","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"authTokenInjector"},{"type":"text","text":" for a new token after a 401."}],"type":"topic"}}}